Package: LFVCR
Type: Package
Title: Latent Factor Varying-Coefficient Regression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Ruofan",
    family = "Wang",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "ppeanutsss@gmail.com")
Description: Extracts latent factors from high-dimensional predictors and
    combines factor-by-feature interactions with the original predictors in a
    sparse group lasso model. The factor count can be estimated with Group
    Factor Analysis (GrFA) or supplied manually; factor extraction is available
    through principal components or an autoencoder.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    GrFA,
    h2o,
    sparsegl,
    stats
URL: https://ruofan-wang.github.io/LFVCR/,
    https://github.com/ruofan-wang/LFVCR
BugReports: https://github.com/ruofan-wang/LFVCR/issues
